  "description": "Winter Wonderland Watercolor Christmas Stickers\nThis set of 36 watercolor Christmas stickers features a variety of winter-themed elements, including snow-covered pine trees, twinkling Christmas lights, red and green ornaments, wreaths with bow decorations, glistening icicles, Christmas stockings, festive garlands, and tinsels. The stickers come with a white border, making them perfect for use on a variety of surfaces, such as scrapbooks, cards, gift wraps, and more.\nFiles: \nThe set includes 36 files in total, divided into 35 PNG files and 1 PSD file. The PNG files are high-quality, 300 DPI images that can be used for a variety of purposes, such as print, web, and digital projects. \nThe PSD file includes the original watercolor paintings, which can be used to create custom designs.\nAdvice for customers: \nThese stickers are perfect for a variety of winter-themed projects, such as scrapbooking, card making, gift wrapping, and more. \nThey can also be used to create custom stickers for websites, social media, and other marketing materials.\nInvite to follow:\n Be sure to follow me on social media for more watercolor illustrations and design inspiration!",
